{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4sg6inZzC36QNesRBj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, weathered by centuries of hands and rain.*\n\n*You hold up a key.*\n\n*A keyhole regards you like a dark, unblinking eye.*\n\n*The key slides in. Tumblers shift — each one a small, reluctant confession. The mechanism groans, debates with itself, then—*\n\n**CLUNK.**\n\n*The door exhales. A thin line of light splits the darkness at its edge. Hinges whisper their rusty hymn as the door swings inward, revealing:*\n\n*A corridor. Long. Lit by something that is not quite firelight and not quite memory. The air tastes of old stone and new possibility.*\n\n*The door holds itself open.*\n\n*It will not hold forever.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":180,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}